      "ordinal": 79,
      "stableKey": "s10200006-p27-at0450",
      "sourceText": "歓迎するよ、ナツキ・スバルくん。エミリア様の陣営へようこそ",
      "character": "",
      "classification": "resource_reference_pending",
      "unchangedFromBase": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10200006,
      "scenarioId": 86,
      "ordinal": 81,
      "stableKey": "s10200006-p27-at0460",
      "sourceText": "お、おおおおッ!や、やった! やったぜ!",
      "character": "",
      "classification": "alias_pending",
      "unchangedFromBase": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10200006,
      "scenarioId": 87,
      "ordinal": 82,
      "stableKey": "s10200006-p27-at0464",
      "sourceText": "ありがとう、クルシュさん！本当に俺、助けてもらってばっかで……",
      "character": "",
      "classification": "alias_pending",
      "unchangedFromBase": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10200006,
      "scenarioId": 88,
      "ordinal": 83,
      "stableKey": "s10200006-p27-at0468p5",
      "sourceText": "……なんで、こんなに良くしてくれたんだ？",
      "character": "",
      "classification": "alias_pending",
      "unchangedFromBase": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10200006,
      "scenarioId": 91,
      "ordinal": 86,
      "stableKey": "s10200006-p27-at0482",
      "sourceText": "……それ、クルシュさんにー番似合わない答えだな",
      "character": "",
      "classification": "alias_pending",
      "unchangedFromBase": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10200006,
      "scenarioId": 93,
      "ordinal": 88,
      "stableKey": "s10200006-p27-at0492",
      "sourceText": "クルシュさん……。\n本当にありがとう。お世話になりました！",
      "character": "",
      "classification": "alias_pending",
      "unchangedFromBase": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10200006,
      "scenarioId": 94,
      "ordinal": 89,
      "stableKey": "s10200006-p27-at0496",
      "sourceText": "フェリスと、ヴィルヘルムさんも。礼を言っても言い足りねえけど、本当にありがとう！",
      "character": "",
      "classification": "alias_pending",
      "unchangedFromBase": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10200006,
      "scenarioId": 97,
      "ordinal": 92,
      "stableKey": "s10200006-p27-at0514",
      "sourceText": "ああ。ああ、もちろんだ。この恩は忘れねえよ。必ず、恩は返す！",
      "character": "",
      "classification": "alias_pending",
      "unchangedFromBase": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10200006,
      "scenarioId": 99,
      "ordinal": 94,
      "stableKey": "s10200006-p27-at0528",
      "sourceText": "……いっちまった、か。\n本当に世話になりっ放しだったな",
      "character": "",
      "classification": "alias_pending",
      "unchangedFromBase": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10200006,
      "scenarioId": 101,
      "ordinal": 96,
      "stableKey": "s10200006-p27-at0539",
      "sourceText": "いやいや、言ったじゃん?俺は君に恩返ししたくて足掻いてたんだ。そりゃ、クルシュさんたちはいい人だよ",
      "character": "",
      "classification": "alias_pending",
      "unchangedFromBase": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10200006,
      "scenarioId": 102,
      "ordinal": 97,
      "stableKey": "s10200006-p27-at0545p5",
      "sourceText": "めちゃくちゃいい人たちだ。俺の心の一番が埋まってなかったら、きっとあそこに残りたいと思ったよ",
      "character": "",
      "classification": "alias_pending",
      "unchangedFromBase": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10200006,
      "scenarioId": 103,
      "ordinal": 98,
      "stableKey": "s10200006-p27-at0552",
      "sourceText": "でも、俺はここがいいんだ。\nそれに、クルシュさんたちにはまた会えるさ",
      "character": "",
      "classification": "alias_pending",
      "unchangedFromBase": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10200006,
      "scenarioId": 105,
      "ordinal": 100,
      "stableKey": "s10200006-p27-at0563",
      "sourceText": "ああ、話したいことたくさんあるぜ。俺が死にかけてたのを助けてもらって、居候生活に終止符を打つ庭いじりとか……",
      "character": "",
      "classification": "alias_pending",
      "unchangedFromBase": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10200006,
      "scenarioId": 106,
      "ordinal": 101,
      "stableKey": "s10200006-p27-at0571",
      "sourceText": "ただ、その前に",
      "character": "",
      "classification": "alias_pending",
      "unchangedFromBase": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10200006,
      "scenarioId": 108,
      "ordinal": 103,
      "stableKey": "s10200006-p27-at0576",
      "sourceText": "あいつらと、ちゃんと話をつけなくちゃだよね？",
      "character": "",
      "classification": "alias_pending",
      "unchangedFromBase": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10200006,
      "scenarioId": 111,
      "ordinal": 106,
      "stableKey": "s10200006-p27-at0586",
      "sourceText": "やれやれ、往生際の悪い。前途多難だね、エミリアたん",
      "character": "",
      "classification": "alias_pending",
      "unchangedFromBase": true
    }
  ],
